Durable Function Structure


BillingArchival/
│
├── __init__.py               # Entry point for orchestration
├── get_old_records.py        # Gets old records from Cosmos DB
├── archive_to_blob.py        # Uploads record to Blob
├── delete_from_cosmos.py     # Deletes record from Cosmos DB
└── host.json                 # Azure Functions config

